---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const results = [
  [
    "Dependencies install successfully.",
    "Dependency installation completed in 0s.",
    "/sample/evidence/install.json",
  ],
  [
    "The application starts and answers an HTTP request.",
    "http://127.0.0.1:4311 answered with HTTP 200.",
    "/sample/evidence/boot.json",
  ],
  [
    "The entry page loads without an HTTP or navigation error.",
    'The entry page returned HTTP 200 with title "Contact us".',
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "The page renders visible content.",
    "The page rendered visible text.",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "No uncaught or application console error occurs.",
    "No uncaught or application console error.",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "Same-origin browser assets load successfully.",
    "Same-origin browser assets loaded.",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "No request returns a 5xx response.",
    "No response returned a 5xx status.",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "Captured same-origin browser content contains no detected secret.",
    "No credential-shaped value in 1 complete same-origin response (3991 bytes).",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
  [
    "The page contacts no unexpected external origin.",
    "The page contacted only declared origins: https://challenges.cloudflare.com",
    "/sample/evidence/browser.json",
  ],
];
---

<Base
  title="Sanitized sample report — Docs Trials"
  description="A real Docs Trials Turnstile attempt with inspectable sanitized evidence."
>
  <article class="report-page shell">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to docs-trials</a>
    <header class="report-header">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Real local attempt · sanitized public copy</p>
        <h1>Attempt Summary</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stamp">
        <span>Baseline</span>
        <strong>Passed</strong>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="report-caveat">
      <strong>Task fulfillment was not verified.</strong>
      <p>
        This report records deterministic baseline observations. It is not a task-completion
        certificate.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="report-summary-note">
      This report renders the real attempt <code>gate2-turnstile-a-20260827-190642-913</code>. Each
      result links to its public evidence. Local paths and ephemeral process identifiers were
      removed; no result-bearing observation changed. The sample is inspectable, but it is not
      independently rerunnable because the starter workspace and frozen documentation bodies are not
      public. <a href="/sample/README.txt">Read the bundle notes</a>, <a
        href="/sample/manifest.json">inspect the frozen manifest</a
      >, or <a href="/sample/results.json">inspect the machine-readable results</a>.
    </p>

    <dl class="report-meta">
      <div><dt>Trial</dt><dd>Turnstile contact form A</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Attempt</dt><dd><code>gate2-turnstile-a-20260827-190642-913</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Checks</dt><dd>9 passed · 0 failed · 0 inconclusive</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Agent</dt><dd>OpenCode · openai/gpt-5.6-sol</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Starter revision</dt><dd><code>1ebd1647e17e</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Manifest digest</dt><dd><code>8474d77f2835d7cd</code></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">01 / Task</p>
      <h2>What the subject agent was asked to build</h2>
      <p class="report-task">
        Using only the supplied documentation for Turnstile, replace the static starter page with a
        contact form protected by the published always-pass test keys. Validate submitted tokens
        server-side before accepting a contact submission. Keep the form at the entry URL.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">02 / Supplied documentation</p>
      <h2>Frozen trial copies and live attribution sources</h2>
      <ul class="document-list">
        <li>
          <span>01</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/client-side-rendering/index.md"
            >Embed the Turnstile widget</a
          ><small
            >Frozen text/markdown; charset=utf-8 body · HTTP 200 at 2026-08-27T19:06:42.926Z ·
            19,383 bytes · SHA-256 85cd864a0ad91233b112e5bcf5c753f5f69841248cf7a0f723801e226cc9478b</small
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>02</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/index.md"
            >Turnstile testing keys</a
          ><small
            >Frozen text/markdown; charset=utf-8 body · HTTP 200 at 2026-08-27T19:06:43.282Z · 7,415
            bytes · SHA-256 09fee37bd6396a9d3696c5792310b35879c7cfebfdb66ea71410e45c4cb30fcd</small
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>03</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/server-side-validation/index.md"
            >Server-side validation</a
          ><small
            >Frozen text/markdown; charset=utf-8 body · HTTP 200 at 2026-08-27T19:06:43.491Z ·
            22,973 bytes · SHA-256 f2de00a4976bff2a46b8b2fc459ab2fe81f2f03bce8f13701f6e0d024449cfb1</small
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">03 / Baseline checks</p>
      <h2 id="baseline-results-heading">These are the only results Docs Trials produced.</h2>
      <div
        class="result-table-wrap"
        role="region"
        tabindex="0"
        aria-labelledby="baseline-results-heading"
      >
        <table class="result-table">
          <caption>Baseline check results</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">No.</th>
              <th scope="col">Outcome</th>
              <th scope="col">Check</th>
              <th scope="col">Observed detail</th>
              <th scope="col">Evidence</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {
              results.map(([check, detail, evidence], index) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="result-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</td>
                  <td class="result-badge">Pass</td>
                  <th class="result-check" scope="row">
                    {check}
                  </th>
                  <td class="result-detail">{detail}</td>
                  <td class="result-evidence">
                    <a href={evidence}>Inspect</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              ))
            }
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="report-split report-section">
      <div>
        <p class="report-section-number">04 / Omitted</p>
        <h2>Build check</h2>
        <p>
          The manifest declared no build command. The check did not apply and received no outcome.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="report-section-number">05 / Ungraded</p>
        <h2>Source changes</h2>
        <p>
          Git-visible changes were retained as <a href="/sample/evidence/source-diff.txt"
            >evidence</a
          >. Git-ignored workspace paths were excluded.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="goals-section report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">06 / Author goals</p>
      <h2>Recorded for context. Not verified.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The contact page displays a visible Turnstile test widget.</li>
        <li>The server rejects a submission without a valid Turnstile token.</li>
        <li>The published always-pass test key pair can complete a submission.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="goals-note">These statements did not change any baseline result.</p>
    </section>

    <aside class="report-reading">
      <h2>How to read this report</h2>
      <p><strong>Pass</strong> means Docs Trials observed the behavior named by that check.</p>
      <p><strong>Fail</strong> means the observation contradicted the check.</p>
      <p><strong>Inconclusive</strong> means there was not enough evidence to decide.</p>
      <p>
        The baseline does not prove that the application fulfills the task or that documentation
        caused an outcome.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <aside class="report-reading">
      <h2>How to investigate this attempt</h2>
      <p>
        Start with a result's <strong>Inspect</strong> link and confirm that the retained observation
        supports its detail. Command and boot checks link to process evidence. Browser checks link to
        navigation, content, console, request, response, content-scan, and origin observations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Use the source diff as ungraded context only. A failed check would be a fact about the
        attempt, not a documentation finding, until separate evidence supported that attribution.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </article>
</Base>
